  "_readme": [
    "One entry per personality. Generic ladies pick one at random; the creator lists them all. Add your own by adding a new key.",
    "likes/dislikes: chat, dinner, gift, train, private, walk, theater (things Sam does with her). jobsUp/jobsDown: job ids she likes or dislikes.",
    "trust: multiplier on trust Sam earns. lewd: multiplier on lewdness growth.",
    "solo: chance (0-1) that at max lust she takes care of it herself instead of acting on it with someone. Costs her energy and fewer clients that night.",
    "modest: chance (0-1) a new lady with this personality gets the Modest trait: she undresses less than her lewdness would allow (clothes pulled aside), loosening as lewdness and trust with Sam rise.",
    "goodNight / badNight: mood change after a week where clients loved her / a rough week with bad clients.",
    "lustBuild: multiplier on how fast her lust builds each week.",
    "expr: optional map that shifts the expression she shows during services (bored / professional / into / lost) to another one (data/snippets.json → expressions), e.g. a shy lady is 'flustered' instead of 'into it'.",
    "stats: stat leans on the 0-100 scale, added to a new generic lady's rolled stats (and used by tools/seed-stats.mjs for named ladies). Keys: beauty, charm, charisma, refinement, wits, stamina, strength, agility."
